  "details": "Version 1133, and has happened on older versions too (can't remember which specific older versions)\nI've tried clearing my cache multiple times, and sometimes this has fixed it for a little bit, then it comes back shortly after. And sometimes it doesn't even fix it. This isn't a full cache issue as it doesn't always happen at around 19gb, like today it happened at 8gb and after i cleared my cache and restarted where the cache was literally none existant. Hiding avatars that show as errors and showing them doesn't fix this either, and the same avatars will show as an error. It happens when joining worlds, and half or more avatars will show as an error, not even all and doesn't seem to be a specific reason. Also while trying to get images of the bug, i encountered another bug i occasionally get, where pictures taken with the vrc camera will sometimes just become corrupted for no reason, also for some reason my steam screenshots got corrupted to...",
